<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6903"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 1:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Q, <BR>I guess the tape is green, I was looking at the tint in the picture. The rug looks beige. <BR> <BR>Lots of similarities. Both girls were found in the basement. <BR> <BR>The killer in both cases came into the homes when the families were there. Very high risk. <BR> <BR>Maybe they should be checking out Ramsey suspects who may have a connection to Wichita.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
