<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10260"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kayjay<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kayjay<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 6:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes its odd that a barbie doll has found its way into this case! JBR was killed xmas night. I wonder where the Rader family spent xmas that year? or could he have been in Colorado with his boy scouts at that time? Do scout groups travel around? <BR> <BR>The Ramsey ransom note included the words: If you talk to a STRAY DOG she dies. <BR>Coincidence?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
