</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 1:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have a feeling that the same guy if not her father, is the one kidnapping these girls in the news right now, from their beds<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10707-->
<!--Post: 11609--><!--Time: 1110937412-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11609"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 5:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.cbsnews.com/stories/2002/10/01/48hours/main523892.shtml" target=_top>http://www.cbsnews.com/stories/2002/10/01/48hours/ main523892.shtml</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11609-->
<!--Post: 11614--><!--Time: 1110942285-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11614"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 7:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->found this post <BR> <BR> <BR>I see there has not been a message posted here for quite a long time. Not sure if anyone even reads this anymore, but I hope Mr. Smit does. This has probably been noticed before but the acronym used at the bottom of the ransom letter S.B.T.C. Could stand for Southern Baptist of Texas Convention, I looked to see if they had any connections with Boulder &#40;although most large cities have Baptist connections&#41; and there are two churches that have a connection. They are Cornerstone of Boulder Valley and East Boulder Baptist Church. Just another conspiracy theory but perhaps the person who committed the crime had some affiliation with one of these churches &#40;maybe not a member, but could have been&#41;. He or she could have gotten that acronym from a church pamphlet or something like that. A long shot I know, but....  <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11614-->
<!--Post: 11709--><!--Time: 1111037597-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11709"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 16, 2005 - 9:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->E - Mr. Smits&#39; office is not far from mine, and you know where I am. We didn&#39;t live here very long when this happened to JonBenet. My daughter is the same age. I was, I guess thrown back into defense mode after leaving Wichita. I couldn&#39;t begin to imagine who would do this to such a beautiful child. I in my heart I never believed that JonBenet&#39;s parents had anything to do with this crime. Just like in my heart I always knew that BTK had murdered Marine. My heart broke for Patsy, John, and Burke Ramsey. JonBenet was going to be the next Ms. Colorado and for all we knew the next Ms. America. She was beautiful, I was very proud of her and she wasn&#39;t even my child. JonBenet was a mirror of the Colorado Rockies and we would have been well represented. All I good invision was that she would blow Ms. Texas off the map. Yeah! Anyway, the Boulder PD was pathetic. When I found out when they released her DNA for testing I almost fell over. The Boulder PD was like a soap opera. Instead of really putting forth a good faith effort into finding out who did that to this beautiful child, they got lazy and humdum and focused everything on Patsy and John. I have to admit, the ransom note was a bit puzzeling. It did request the exact amount of Mr. Ramsey&#39;s bonus. How many people would know what his bonus was going to be?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11709-->
<!--Post: 12155--><!--Time: 1111676272-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12155"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 6:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think Mr. Smit is still working on JonBenet&#39;s case. <BR> <BR>Wouldn&#39;t hurt to compare DNA.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12155-->
<!--Post: 12159--><!--Time: 1111678979-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12159"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 7:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->NO kidding!  I hope they do!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12159-->
<!--Post: 12160--><!--Time: 1111679007-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12160"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 7:43 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->SURELY LE will!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12160-->
<!--Post: 12176--><!--Time: 1111711718-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12176"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 4:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->From what I can recall of this crime a garote was used, and the phone lines were not cut.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12176-->
<!--Post: 12205--><!--Time: 1111764382-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12205"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The bondage was the same...so were the knots and semen at the scene! <BR>I live quite near Boulder.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12205-->
<!--Post: 12239--><!--Time: 1111791401-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12239"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 2:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I could be very wrong but it seems that BTK always was able to move throughout neighborhoods &amp; the community due to his uniform/public service position.  <BR> <BR>Hiding in plain site. <BR> <BR>Was the Ramsey home completely isolated so that BTK could drive a car to the home undetected and not be seen by potential witnesses ?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12239-->
<!--Post: 12251--><!--Time: 1111806718-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12251"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kayjay<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kayjay<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tac, the Ramsey home was not isolated, it had nearby neighbors. <BR>Rocky, I guess it would be useless to cut the phone line as by 1996 almost everyone had a cell phone.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12251-->
<!--Post: 12255--><!--Time: 1111808137-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12255"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good point Kayjay! I forget sometimes that we are dealing with different time frames. Else- As the name implies I live near the Rockies as well.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12255-->
<!--Post: 12262--><!--Time: 1111810434-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12262"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 8:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->They did have a security system, which they didn&#39;t turn on. ADT is a big company. I wonder who the Ramseys used.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12262-->
<!--Post: 12345--><!--Time: 1112024441-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12345"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 7:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ADT is all over Colorado!  Used to be Security Link and ADT bought them out&#62;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12345-->
<!--Post: 12441--><!--Time: 1112230674-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12441"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 30, 2005 - 4:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A few more coincidences? Perhaps Rader was at his father&#39;s bedside on December 26, 1996? <BR> <BR>Under the &#34;Facts About Dennis Rader&#34; thread it is said the his father died on December 27, 1996, which happens to be the day after Jon Benet was killed, the day she was actually found. <BR> <BR>In the ransom note, P.2, the Ramsey&#39;s are warned &#34;If we catch you talking to a stray dog, she dies.&#34;  Very odd for any ransom note. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12441-->
<!--Post: 12765--><!--Time: 1113061360-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12765"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 09, 2005 - 8:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My mistake. JonBenet was found on December 26th.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12765-->
